:<nowiki>*</nowiki> ''Served as an MP in the 2005–2010 Parliament''

The new seat of Chelsea and Fulham was fought for the first time at the [[2010 United Kingdom general election|2010 general election]], when it had a notional [[Conservative Party (UK)|Conservative]] majority of over 10,000 based on 2005 election results.<ref>[http://generalelection2010.timesonline.co.uk/#/Election05/Chelsea_and_Fulham Times Online guide to the Chelsea and Fulham constituency] {{webarchive |url=https://web.archive.org/web/20100429094548/http://generalelection2010.timesonline.co.uk/#/Election05/Chelsea_and_Fulham |date=April 29, 2010 }}</ref>

